From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: route Sugar keys through Journal surface

Journal is a real GTK4 shell surface. Once it owns focus, the main-window
controller is no longer on the event path, leaving F1-F6 apparently inert.
Attach the existing semantic key handler to the Journal surface as it is
initialized, preserving one process-local handler and GTK3 isolation.

--- a/src/jarabe/main.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/main.py
@@ -114,7 +114,11 @@
 def setup_journal_cb():
     logging.debug('STARTUP: setup_journal_cb')
     journalactivity.start()
+    journal = journalactivity.get_journal()
+    semantic_keys = keyhandler.get_instance()
+    if semantic_keys is not None:
+        semantic_keys.add_window(journal)
 
